`crates/raft-verified/src/lib.rs`. Compare with `Node`, `fresh_node`, `initial`,
`init` and `well_formed` in `crates/raft-spec/src/lib.rs`. The concrete Node type,
constructor signature and representation are still to be designed. Recommend a
single owned state with an explicit view; record API questions under ADR-01/03.
Do not silently approve a new state representation or change the model.

